  "Updated manifests: 0-AI-MANIFEST.a2ml (core narrative + invariants), META.a2ml (ADR-0001), NEUROSYM.a2ml (3 symbolic rules), ECOSYSTEM.a2ml (lineage), AGENTIC.a2ml (constraint)",
